hadiths[1]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1132","Ali bin Qurrah bin Habib bin Yazid bin Matar Al-Rammah narrated to us, my father narrated to us, Shu’bah informed us, on the authority of Ya’la bin Ata, on the authority of Abd Al-Rahman, on the authority of Abu Hurairah, said: The Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “When a servant sleeps, Satan will tie three knots over him. He fell ill at night and remembered God. He untied a knot, and if he performed ablution, two knots were untied, and if he prayed two rak’ahs, all the knots were untied, so they untied Satan’s knots. Even if it is two rak'ahs."""
